  "subTitleDesc": null,
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "微生物醱酵工程",
    "sub_ename": "MICROORGANISM FERMENTATION ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "生物技術的急速發展帶動了一種對於微生物醱酵技術的研發風潮，由於生化學家在實驗室中進行研究，往往需要仰賴微生物細胞，當其所研發的產品具有商業價值時，便需要運用微生物醱酵技術來放大生產，因此本課程之目的便是介紹微生物製造程序中的單元操作工程技術，課程內容包括微生物細胞的生化結構和生理行為、菌株的篩選和培養、菌株生長動力學、酵素動力學、培養基最適化設計、培養基清潔技術、菌株接種程序、醱酵槽設計、操作與控制等。在課程中，將爰用實例來加以說明微生物醱酵程序中各相關工程技術之運用原理。",
    "describe_eh": "The rapid growth of biotechnology has led to an upsurge in intensive researches on microbial technology. Scientists from the field of biochemistry, biology, and genetics usually rely on the use of microorganisms, especially microbes, to conduct their fundamental experiments in the lab. Once the research results are verified with high commercial value, the employment of microbes for the large-scale production of products becomes the most effective and practical way of choice. For scale up of the production process, it will call for the pressing need for the microbial fermentation technology. Therefore, the aim of this course is to introduce many unit operations essential for a bioprocess developed by using microbes. The subjects offered by this course consist of biochemical structure and physiological behavior of microbes, screening and culturing of microbes, microbial growth kinetics, enzyme kinetics, culture medium optimization, medium sterilization technique, inoculum development process, fermenter design, and fermenter operation and control. In addition, a few good practical examples will be given to help students to catch the essences of the fermentation techniques instructed in this course.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": " 能理解一個發酵程序包含那些重要單元",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension for the essential units of a fermentation process"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": " 能瞭解一個細胞生命如何延續；能學習尊重生命",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension for a cell lives on its own；be able to learn to respect and cherish the life."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能理解發酵程序對於人類生活的重要性及影響",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension for the importance of the fermentation process to human life."
    }
  ],
